    %% Diagrama de arquitetura geral do PetCare360

    classDef client fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0,stroke-width:1px,color:#0D47A1
    classDef api fill:#E8F5E9,stroke:#2E7D32,stroke-width:1px,color:#1B5E20
    classDef business fill:#FFF8E1,stroke:#F9A825,stroke-width:1px,color:#5D4037
    classDef data fill:#F3E5F5,stroke:#6A1B9A,stroke-width:1px,color:#4A148C
    classDef support fill:#ECEFF1,stroke:#455A64,stroke-width:1px,color:#263238
    classDef iot fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#EF6C00,stroke-width:1px,color:#E65100

    Usuario["Tutor / Professor / Cliente API"]:::client
    Swagger["Swagger UI / Postman"]:::client
    Collar["Coleira Inteligente<br/>Dados IoT simulados"]:::iot

    Controllers["Controllers REST<br/>Auth, Pets, IoT, Monitoring"]:::api
    DTOs["DTOs<br/>Requests e Responses"]:::api
    Services["Services<br/>Regras de negocio"]:::business
    Mapper["PetMapper<br/>Conversao Entity -> DTO"]:::business

    Repositories["Repositories<br/>Spring Data JPA"]:::data
    Oracle["Oracle SQL<br/>users, pets, devices, sensor_data, alerts"]:::data

    Security["Security<br/>JWT + BCrypt"]:::support
    Cache["Cache<br/>@Cacheable / @CacheEvict"]:::support
    Exceptions["Exception Handler<br/>Erros padronizados"]:::support
    SwaggerDoc["OpenAPI / Swagger<br/>Documentacao da API"]:::support

    Usuario --> Swagger
    Swagger --> Controllers
    Collar -->|"POST /api/iot/data"| Controllers

    Controllers --> DTOs
    Controllers --> Services
    Services --> Mapper
    Services --> Repositories
    Repositories --> Oracle

    Controllers --> SwaggerDoc
    Services --> Security
    Services --> Cache
    Services --> Exceptions
